3。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="816" top="682" width="720"><Text fontSize="18" color="#9DAEC7" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">若问题属于结构层面，则同时沿 N10→N08 虚线回到构建环节重做版式与 DSL。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="816" top="716" width="720"><Text fontSize="18" color="#6A7C96" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">N04→N13 的实线表示数据结果可直接用于校验，与修复回路互不替代。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="32" top="950" width="1100"><Text fontSize="17" color="#6A7C96" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">节点文字 22px；注释 18px。所有先决边一律自左（较浅层）指向右（较深层），反馈边单独用紫色虚线并标注语义。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="1100" top="950" width="468"><Text fontSize="17" color="#6A7C96" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="RIGHT">run_id 20261103T152640-suite</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="40" top="796"><Container width="1520" height="96" color="#0C1421" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #1B2840"/></Positioned><Positioned left="60" top="844"><Container width="6" height="6" color="#38BDF8" borderRadius="3"/></Positioned><Positioned left="76" top="838"><Text fontSize="18" color="#E8EEF8" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">同层并行</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="76" top="862" width="484"><Text fontSize="17" color="#6A7C96" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">同层节点并行，层号越大越靠后；左色条表示阶段。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="566" top="844"><Container width="6" height="6" color="#38BDF8" borderRadius="3"/></Positioned><Positioned left="582" top="838"><Text fontSize="18" color="#E8EEF8" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">方向无歧义</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="582" top="862" width="484"><Text fontSize="17" color="#6A7C96" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">实线只从较小层指向较大层，方向无歧义。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="1072" top="844"><Container width="6" height="6" color="#38BDF8" borderRadius="3"/></Positioned><Positioned left="1088" top="838"><Text fontSize="18" color="#E8EEF8" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">绕行与交叉</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="1088" top="862" width="484"><Text fontSize="17" color="#6A7C96" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">N03→N06 下绕、N04→N13 上绕；交叉无节点非依赖。</Text></Positioned></Stack></Container></Snapshot>